# Data Analytics Project 4 - Data Visualization

## Project Overview

This project focuses on data visualization using Python. Various charts and graphs were created to analyze sales performance, payment methods, order status, referral sources, and revenue generation.

## Tools & Technologies

* Python
* Pandas
* Matplotlib
* Google Colab

## Dataset Features

* Order ID
* Date
* Customer ID
* Product
* Quantity
* Unit Price
* Payment Method
* Order Status
* Referral Source
* Total Price

## Visualizations Created

1. Product Sales Bar Chart
2. Payment Method Pie Chart
3. Order Status Distribution Chart
4. Referral Source Analysis Chart
5. Revenue by Product Chart

## Key Insights

* Different products contribute differently to total sales.
* Customers use multiple payment methods.
* Order status analysis helps monitor business performance.
* Referral sources influence customer acquisition.
* Revenue visualization highlights top-performing products.

## Outcome

The project successfully transformed raw business data into meaningful visual insights using Python-based data visualization techniques.

